    "text": "<math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2.76</mn></mrow></munder><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow></mover><munder><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munder></math> <br/><br/>Note:  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>  is thermally unstable and decompose on heating liberating oxygen.<br/><br/>Molecular weight of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>276</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> <br/><br/>So 276 g of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>  on heating gives residue<br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>108</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>216</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>  of Ag<br/><br/>So 2.76 of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>  on heating gives  <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>216</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>276</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>2.76</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2.16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>  of Ag"
